    "hardBudget": "Adaptive, frequency, and oracle policies retain at most 20,000 domain-checkpoint bytes. The 70,000-byte all-seven policy is explicitly over budget and is retained only as a reference.",
    "adaptiveAdmission": "Uncheckpointed domains use a deterministic position-weighted replay-opportunity estimate based on observed full replay cost and mutation position. Retained checkpoints use measured avoided replay. Admission also charges one full-domain build-cost penalty.",
